# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"
msgstr "Pengenalan kepada Qiskit {#introduction-to-qiskit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The name \"Qiskit\" is a general term referring to a collection of software for executing programs on quantum computers. Most notable among these software tools is the open-source Qiskit SDK, and the runtime environment, accessed using IBM Quantum Compute Service (formerly known as the Qiskit Runtime Service), through which you can execute workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs). As quantum technology evolves, so does Qiskit, with new capabilities released every year that expand this core collection of quantum software.\n"
msgstr "Nama \"Qiskit\" ialah istilah umum yang merujuk kepada koleksi perisian untuk melaksanakan atur cara pada komputer kuantum. Antara alat perisian ini yang paling ketara ialah Qiskit SDK sumber terbuka, dan persekitaran runtime, yang diakses menggunakan IBM Quantum Compute Service (dahulunya dikenali sebagai Qiskit Runtime Service), yang melaluinya anda boleh melaksanakan beban kerja pada unit pemprosesan kuantum (QPU) IBM&reg;. Seiring dengan perkembangan teknologi kuantum, Qiskit turut berkembang, dengan keupayaan baharu dikeluarkan setiap tahun yang memperluas koleksi teras perisian kuantum ini.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition, many open-source projects are part of the broader Qiskit ecosystem. These software tools are not part of Qiskit itself, but rather interface with Qiskit and can provide valuable additional functionality.\n"
msgstr "Selain itu, banyak projek sumber terbuka merupakan sebahagian daripada ekosistem Qiskit yang lebih luas. Alat perisian ini bukan sebahagian daripada Qiskit itu sendiri, tetapi berhubung dengan Qiskit dan boleh menyediakan fungsi tambahan yang berharga.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM is committed to the responsible development of quantum computing. Learn more and review our responsible quantum principles in the [Responsible quantum computing](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing) topic.\n"
msgstr "IBM komited terhadap pembangunan pengkomputeran kuantum yang bertanggungjawab. Ketahui lebih lanjut dan semak prinsip kuantum bertanggungjawab kami dalam topik [Pengkomputeran kuantum bertanggungjawab](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/responsible-quantum-computing).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK {#the-qiskit-sdk}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit SDK (package name [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) is an open-source SDK for working with quantum computers at the level of extended (static, dynamic, and scheduled) quantum circuits, operators, and primitives. This library is the core component of Qiskit; it is the largest package under the Qiskit name with the broadest suite of tools for quantum computation, and many other components interface with it.\n"
msgstr "Qiskit SDK (nama pakej [`qiskit`](https://pypi.org/project/qiskit/)) ialah SDK sumber terbuka untuk bekerja dengan komputer kuantum pada peringkat litar kuantum lanjutan (statik, dinamik dan berjadual), operator dan primitif. Pustaka ini ialah komponen teras Qiskit; ia pakej terbesar di bawah nama Qiskit dengan set alat paling luas untuk pengiraan kuantum, dan banyak komponen lain berhubung dengannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some of the most useful features of the Qiskit SDK include:\n"
msgstr "Antara ciri Qiskit SDK yang paling berguna termasuk:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit-building tools** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - For initializing and manipulating registers, circuits, instructions, gates, parameters, and control flow objects.\n"
msgstr "**Alat pembinaan litar** ([`qiskit.circuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit)) - Untuk memulakan dan memanipulasi daftar, litar, arahan, gate, parameter dan objek aliran kawalan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit library** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - A vast range of circuits, instructions, and gates - key building blocks for circuit-based quantum computations.\n"
msgstr "**Pustaka litar** ([`qiskit.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit_library)) - Pelbagai jenis litar, arahan dan gate - blok binaan utama untuk pengiraan kuantum berasaskan litar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Quantum info library** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - A toolkit for working with quantum states, operators and channels, using exact calculations (no sampling noise). Use this module to specify input observables and analyze fidelity of outputs from primitives queries.\n"
msgstr "**Pustaka maklumat kuantum** ([`qiskit.quantum_info`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info)) - Kit alat untuk bekerja dengan keadaan, operator dan saluran kuantum, menggunakan pengiraan tepat (tiada hingar pensampelan). Gunakan modul ini untuk menentukan observable input dan menganalisis kesetiaan output daripada pertanyaan primitif.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - For transforming and adapting quantum circuits to suit specific device topology, and optimizing for execution on real quantum processing units (QPUs).\n"
msgstr "**Transpiler** ([`qiskit.transpiler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler)) - Untuk mengubah dan menyesuaikan litar kuantum agar sesuai dengan topologi peranti tertentu, dan mengoptimumkan pelaksanaan pada unit pemprosesan kuantum (QPU) sebenar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Primitives** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - The module that contains the base definitions and reference implementations of the Sampler and Estimator primitives, from which different quantum hardware providers can derive their own implementations. See more information about the IBM Quantum primitives [in the documentation](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"
msgstr "**Primitif** ([`qiskit.primitives`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/primitives)) - Modul yang mengandungi takrifan asas dan pelaksanaan rujukan primitif Sampler dan Estimator, yang daripadanya pembekal perkakasan kuantum yang berbeza boleh menerbitkan pelaksanaan mereka sendiri. Lihat maklumat lanjut tentang primitif IBM Quantum [dalam dokumentasi](/guides/qiskit-runtime-primitives).\n"

