# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking {#benchmarking}"
msgstr "Penanda aras {#benchmarking}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarking is important for comparing the relative performance of quantum software across different stages of a development workflow. Benchmarking tests for quantum software might, for example, look at the speed and quality of building, manipulating, and transpiling circuits. IBM Quantum is committed to delivering the most performant SDK possible, and to that end, the Qiskit SDK is benchmarked using over 1,000 tests developed by leading universities, national labs, and researchers at IBM. The benchmarking suite used for these tests, named Benchpress, is now available as [an open-source package](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). You can now use the Benchpress package to perform your own analysis of quantum SDK performance.\n"
msgstr "Penanda aras penting untuk membandingkan prestasi relatif perisian kuantum merentasi peringkat berbeza aliran kerja pembangunan. Ujian penanda aras untuk perisian kuantum mungkin, sebagai contoh, melihat kelajuan dan kualiti membina, memanipulasi dan men-transpile litar. IBM Quantum komited untuk menyampaikan SDK berprestasi tertinggi yang mungkin, dan untuk tujuan itu, Qiskit SDK dinilai prestasinya menggunakan lebih 1,000 ujian yang dibangunkan oleh universiti terkemuka, makmal kebangsaan dan penyelidik di IBM. Set penanda aras yang digunakan untuk ujian ini, bernama Benchpress, kini tersedia sebagai [pakej sumber terbuka](https://github.com/qiskit/benchpress). Anda kini boleh menggunakan pakej Benchpress untuk melakukan analisis prestasi SDK kuantum anda sendiri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
