msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - Learn about the library of circuits and instructions available in the Qiskit [circuit library](/guides/circuit-library).\n"
"  - Read about the Qiskit transpiler and the many options for transpilation in the [Transpiler](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"  - Find out how to use the [primitive interface](/guides/primitives) to streamline quantum programming.\n"
"  - Check out the [Qiskit ecosystem](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) which hosts open-source projects interfacing and extending the functionality of Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"  - Ketahui tentang pustaka litar dan arahan yang tersedia dalam [pustaka litar](/guides/circuit-library) Qiskit.\n"
"  - Baca tentang Transpiler Qiskit dan pelbagai pilihan untuk transpilasi dalam bahagian [Transpiler](/guides/transpile).\n"
"  - Ketahui cara menggunakan [antara muka primitif](/guides/primitives) untuk memudahkan pengaturcaraan kuantum.\n"
"  - Lihat [ekosistem Qiskit](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/ecosystem) yang menjadi hos projek sumber terbuka yang berhubung dengan dan memperluas fungsi Qiskit\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
